          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "My homegirl a knot-tier, she like thirty-two (Thirty-two)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "They sharin' pictures of these moments, shit is really cute",
          "rhyme": "yt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "And all I got is photos of my 'Rari and some silly suits (Man)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Mhm, will I flip the switch and finally settle down?",
          "rhyme": "awn",
